1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:10,379
Euronews reports that Canadian Prime Minister Mark Carney will address the European Parliament in September as Ottawa seeks closer EU ties.

2
00:00:10,329 --> 00:00:19,623
The move follows a sharp trade fight with Washington, including new US duties on Canadian goods and planned Canadian counter-tariffs.

3
00:00:19,623 --> 00:00:26,344
Brussels and Ottawa both want more stable partners while global trade becomes more political.

